{"id": "Ugwe1BM40nF3BReAAhp4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 26, "text": "I'm not gonna pretend I had it all figured out, because I didn't. Manifesting felt like failing for years. I'd try, get nowhere, tell myself I'd get it next time, and then nothing again. It got to the point where I figured maybe some people just aren't wired for it and I was one of them. Then I took Vera Hart's archetype quiz, kind of as a last thing to try. And it hit something. My archetype just fit, in a way that made me go oh. No fireworks, no life suddenly fixed. But for the first time I had direction instead of just fumbling in the dark hoping something would stick. If you're struggling with it too, honestly, do the quiz. Its free anyway.", "published": "2026-07-12T07:58:57", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugy0coT7d_kvwKBFRyB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "Tellement de gens parlent de ce test d'archétype de Vera Hart, c'est dingue ! Je l'ai essayé moi-même et les résultats sont plutôt prometteurs !", "published": "2026-07-12T07:58:50", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
